  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core TreeMap control visualizes hierarchical data as a set of nested rectangles, where each rectangle represents a data item sized and colored proportionally to its value. It supports multiple layout algorithms (squarified, slice and dice, strip), multiple levels of hierarchy, drill-down, data labels, tooltips, legends, color mapping (range, equal, desaturation), selection, and responsive design. It is ideal for representing file system sizes, market share, portfolio performance, and category breakdowns in ASP.NET Core dashboards and reports.",
